      "content": "Wait, \"like a clever little goblin\"? I'm not sure I follow. I'm looking for actual entomological causes here. Are you suggesting they are actually leaf miners? I haven't seen any white worm-like things on the underside yet, just the holes. Is there anything else it could be if it's not miners?",
